                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: Sum of all employees&apos; salaries</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11' italic='true'>LTI Spend</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: Sum of all employees&apos; stocks granted amounts</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Pay Mix - % of Salary</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>:  Fraction of base salary on the total compensation for each employee</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Pay Mix - % of LTIP</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>:  Fraction of LTIP on the total compensation for each employee</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>Modifiers</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Range Midpoint Increase</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: Percentage increase of midpoints of salary bands</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Salary Increase</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: Percentage increase of salaries</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11' italic='true'>CR Threshold for Salary Increase</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: Threshold of comp ratio below which the salary increase is applied (e.g. simulation of salary increase only for employees with a current comp ratio of 0.9, meaning with a current annualized salary being 90% of the midpoint of their salary band)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Bring all Salaries to a minimum CR of</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: Minimum comp ratio to be allowed in the simulation (e.g. all salaries to be minimum at 90% of the midpoint of their salary band)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11' italic='true'>LTIP Target Increase</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: percentage increase of all LTIP targets</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11' italic='true'>LTIP Increase</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: percentage increase of all LTIP granted amounts</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Threshold CR for LTIP Increase</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: Threshold of comp ratio below which the LTIP increase is applied (e.g. simulation of LTIP increase only for employees with a current comp ratio of 0.9, meaning with a current granted amount being 90% of their target)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11' italic='true'>LTIP Bring All to Target</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: Force all employees to have minimum their LTIP target as granted amount</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
