                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='67834' id='439' type-v2='text' w='92432' x='3772' y='15333'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='14'>Purpose</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>This dashboard was designed to assess current comp-ratios within DHSE based on base salary and/or LTIP and pay mixes and simulate potential scenarios based on different modifiers.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>It was created on the request of Total Rewards team, which is the only one having direct access to it.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>1 - Base Salary</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: The report allows to simulate the average base salary comp ratio, its distribution and pay bill based on some base salary modifiers.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>2 - LTIP</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Open Sans' fontsize='11'>: The report allows to simulate the average LTIP comp ratio and its distribution based on some LTIP modifiers.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
